    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Unleash the Beast Within</p></blockquote><p>Barbarians who walk the Path of the Beast draw their Rage from a bestial spark burning in their souls. That beast bursts forth in the throes of Rage, physically transforming the Barbarian. The spark might come from a curse, a lycanthropic ancestor, a pact with a primal spirit, or a feral childhood.</p><p><em>Subclass of Tasha's Cauldron of Everything, adapted to the 2024 rules by Owidyn.</em></p><h3>Path of the Beast Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.pFEabBfFNxBFf2u8]{Form of the Beast}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.UUTDjJoX0oFILPGm]{Bestial Soul}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.4YzKnBGIFdPQHUSu]{Infectious Fury}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.xc1o6pyRAyH2sbE6]{Call the Hunt}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
